===== case-detail =====
observed-http-status: not-attempted
reason: no object id was present in the captured case-list response and
  SMOKE_CASE_ID was not supplied, so there was no object to resolve.  This
  is recorded as an observation rather than omitted: an empty list is a
  legitimate state on a freshly provisioned stack, and the two runs must
  agree about it like any other observation.

